exports[`switched off (no readingPaths in the contract), the Reader and its Guide are the base's byte for byte > reader guide, reading paths switched off 1`] = `"<div style="flex: 1 1 0%; min-height: 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column;"><div style="flex-shrink: 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); padding: 22px 32px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px;"><div style="display: flex; align-items: baseline; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;"><span style="font-family: &quot;JetBrains Mono&quot;, &quot;Fira Code&quot;, ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, monospace; font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: 0.18em; color: var(--faint);">READER</span><button type="button" style="background: none; padding: 0px; font-family: &quot;JetBrains Mono&quot;, &quot;Fira Code&quot;, ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, monospace; font-size: 11px; color: var(--amber-link); text-decoration: underline; text-underline-offset: 2px; cursor: pointer;">← Library</button><span style="font-family: &quot;JetBrains Mono&quot;, &quot;Fira Code&quot;, ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, monospace; font-style: italic; color: var(--text-italic);">Matrices</span><div style="margin-left: auto; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;"><span style="color: var(--faint); font-size: 11px;">I want to</span><div class="term-select" style="position: relative; display: inline-block; width: 150px;"><div class="term-select-control" tabindex="0" role="combobox" aria-controls=":r:" aria-expanded="false" aria-haspopup="listbox" style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; box-sizing: border-box; width: 100%; font-family: &quot;JetBrains Mono&quot;, &quot;Fira Code&quot;, ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, monospace; font-size: 12px; padding: 4px 12px; background: var(--input); border: 1px solid var(--border); color: var(--text); cursor: pointer; opacity: 1; pointer-events: auto; outline: none; user-select: none;"><span style="flex: 1 1 0%; overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis; white-space: nowrap;">read closely</span><span style="color: var(--faint); font-size: 11px;">▾</span></div></div></div></div><span style="font-family: &quot;JetBrains Mono&quot;, &quot;Fira Code&quot;, ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, monospace; font-size: 13px; color: var(--dim);">Select a passage to ask about it, mark it, or make your own practice.</span><div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; min-width: 0;"><span style="color: var(--faint); font-size: 11px; flex-shrink: 0;">reading</span><div style="height: 3px; flex: 1 1 0%; max-width: 280px; background: var(--border); overflow: hidden;" aria-label="100% read"><div style="height: 100%; width: 100%; background: var(--amber);"></div></div><span style="color: var(--faint); font-size: 10px;">100%</span><button type="button" aria-pressed="true" style="margin-left: auto; border: 0px; background: transparent; color: var(--amber-link); font-family: &quot;JetBrains Mono&quot;, &quot;Fira Code&quot;, ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, monospace; font-size: 11px; cursor: pointer; padding: 0px;">quick checks on</button></div></div><div style="flex: 1 1 0%; min-height: 0; display: flex; overflow: hidden;"><div role="main" aria-label="Matrices" class="ll-scroll" style="flex: 1 1 0%; overflow-y: auto; padding: 18px 32px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 12px; position: relative;"><div data-span-id="span_symmetric_intro" data-extraction-id="ext_symmetric" style="font-family: &quot;JetBrains Mono&quot;, &quot;Fira Code&quot;, ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, monospace; font-size: 15px; color: var(--amber); line-height: 1.7; border-left: 3px solid transparent; padding-left: 12px;"><div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;"></div><div>## Symmetric matrices and variance</div></div><div data-span-id="span_symmetric_prose" data-extraction-id="ext_symmetric" style="font-family: &quot;JetBrains Mono&quot;, &quot;Fira Code&quot;, ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, monospace; font-size: 13px; color: var(--text); line-height: 1.7; border-left: 3px solid transparent; padding-left: 12px;"><div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;"></div><div>A real symmetric matrix $A = A^\\top$ admits an orthonormal eigenbasis. When choosing a decomposition for a variance problem, the **spectral decomposition** is preferred over a general SVD because the eigenvalues are the variances along principal axes.</div></div><div data-span-id="span_spectral_worked" data-extraction-id="ext_symmetric" style="font-family: &quot;JetBrains Mono&quot;, &quot;Fira Code&quot;, ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, monospace; font-size: 13px; color: var(--text); line-height: 1.7; border-left: 3px solid var(--amber); padding-left: 12px;"><div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;"><span style="font-family: &quot;JetBrains Mono&quot;, &quot;Fira Code&quot;, ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, monospace; font-size: 12px; color: var(--pill-amber-fg); background: var(--pill-amber-bg); padding: 1px 8px; border-radius: 2px; white-space: nowrap;">suspect · crop_adjacent</span></div><div>Worked example: for $A = \\begin{bmatrix} 2 &amp; 1 \\\\ 1 &amp; 2 \\end{bmatrix}$, the eigenvalues $3$ and $1$ are the variances along the eigenvectors $(1,1)/\\sqrt2$ and $(1,-1)/\\sqrt2$.</div></div></div><div role="complementary" aria-label="Reading guide" style="width: 360px; height: 100%; min-height: 0; flex-shrink: 0; border-left: 1px solid var(--border); padding: 18px 20px; overflow-x: hidden; overflow-y: auto; overscroll-behavior-y: contain; scrollbar-gutter: stable;" class="ll-scroll"><div style="position: sticky; top: -18px; z-index: 8; margin: -18px -20px 16px; padding: 12px 20px 10px; background: var(--bg); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 6px;"><div style="display: flex; gap: 4px;"><button type="button" aria-pressed="true" aria-label="guide" style="flex: 1 1 0%; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; gap: 6px; border: 1px solid var(--border-focus); background: var(--wash-amber); color: var(--amber-link); font-family: &quot;JetBrains Mono&quot;, &quot;Fira Code&quot;, ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, monospace; font-size: 11px; padding: 6px 8px; cursor: pointer; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.08em;">guide</button><button type="button" aria-pressed="false" aria-label="ask" style="flex: 1 1 0%; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; gap: 6px; border: 1px solid var(--border); background: transparent; color: var(--dim); font-family: &quot;JetBrains Mono&quot;, &quot;Fira Code&quot;, ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, monospace; font-size: 11px; padding: 6px 8px; cursor: pointer; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.08em;">ask</button><button type="button" aria-pressed="false" aria-label="notes" style="flex: 1 1 0%; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; gap: 6px; border: 1px solid var(--border); background: transparent; color: var(--dim); font-family: &quot;JetBrains Mono&quot;, &quot;Fira Code&quot;, ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, monospace; font-size: 11px; padding: 6px 8px; cursor: pointer; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.08em;">notes</button></div></div><div style="display: block;"><div style="font-family: &quot;JetBrains Mono&quot;, &quot;Fira Code&quot;, ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, monospace; font-size: 14px; color: var(--amber); text-decoration: underline; text-underline-offset: 3px; margin-bottom: 14px; margin-top: 0px;">Reading guide</div><div style="font-family: &quot;JetBrains Mono&quot;, &quot;Fira Code&quot;, ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, monospace; border-left: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 2px; padding: 14px 18px; background: var(--wash-cyan); cursor: default; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 5px; margin-bottom: 10px;"><span style="color: var(--faint); font-size: 10px; letter-spacing: 0.12em;">YOUR PATH</span><span style="font-family: &quot;JetBrains Mono&quot;, &quot;Fira Code&quot;, ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, monospace; font-size: 12px; color: var(--text);">Derive mixture distributions</span><span style="color: var(--faint); font-size: 10px;">Reading toward your active goal</span></div></div><div style="display: none;"><div style="font-family: &quot;JetBrains Mono&quot;, &quot;Fira Code&quot;, ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, monospace; font-size: 14px; color: var(--amber); text-decoration: underline; text-underline-offset: 3px; margin-bottom: 14px; margin-top: 0px;">Capture</div><span style="color: var(--faint); font-size: 12px;">select text to capture it · hold ctrl and drag one or more boxes, release ctrl to capture their union.</span><div style="font-family: &quot;JetBrains Mono&quot;, &quot;Fira Code&quot;, ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, monospace; font-size: 14px; color: var(--amber); text-decoration: underline; text-underline-offset: 3px; margin-bottom: 14px; margin-top: 22px;">Make your own practice</div><button type="button" style="font-family: &quot;JetBrains Mono&quot;, &quot;Fira Code&quot;, ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, monospace; font-size: 13px; padding: 6px 16px; border-radius: 2px; cursor: pointer; background: transparent; color: var(--dim);">write my own question</button><div style="font-family: &quot;JetBrains Mono&quot;, &quot;Fira Code&quot;, ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, monospace; font-size: 14px; color: var(--amber); text-decoration: underline; text-underline-offset: 3px; margin-bottom: 14px; margin-top: 22px;">Annotations</div><span style="color: var(--faint); font-size: 12px;">no annotations yet.</span></div><div style="display: none;"><div style="font-family: &quot;JetBrains Mono&quot;, &quot;Fira Code&quot;, ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, monospace; font-size: 14px; color: var(--amber); text-decoration: underline; text-underline-offset: 3px; margin-bottom: 14px; margin-top: 0px;">Ask</div><