pan></div></div></div><textarea placeholder="ask about this passage…" style="font-family: &quot;JetBrains Mono&quot;, &quot;Fira Code&quot;, ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, monospace; font-size: 12px; background: var(--input); border: 1px solid var(--border); color: var(--text); padding: 8px; min-height: 70px; resize: vertical;"></textarea><button type="button" disabled="" style="font-family: &quot;JetBrains Mono&quot;, &quot;Fira Code&quot;, ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, monospace; font-size: 13px; padding: 6px 16px; border-radius: 2px; cursor: default; background: transparent; border: 1px solid var(--border); color: var(--faint);">ask · ctrl+↵</button><div style="font-family: &quot;JetBrains Mono&quot;, &quot;Fira Code&quot;, ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, monospace; font-size: 14px; color: var(--amber); text-decoration: underline; text-underline-offset: 3px; margin-bottom: 14px; margin-top: 22px;">Clarification threads</div><div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;"><span style="color: var(--faint); font-size: 10px;">0 saved</span><button type="button" title="find in previous asks (ctrl+f)" aria-label="find in previous asks" style="margin-left: auto; width: 20px; height: 18px; border: 1px solid var(--border); background: transparent; color: var(--dim); font-family: &quot;JetBrains Mono&quot;, &quot;Fira Code&quot;, ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, monospace; font-size: 11px; cursor: pointer; padding: 0px;">⌕</button></div><span style="color: var(--faint); font-size: 11px;">No saved asks for this source yet.</span><div style="font-family: &quot;JetBrains Mono&quot;, &quot;Fira Code&quot;, ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, monospace; font-size: 12px;"><button type="button" style="background: transparent; color: var(--faint); cursor: pointer; font-family: &quot;JetBrains Mono&quot;, &quot;Fira Code&quot;, ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, monospace; font-size: 12px; padding: 0px;">▸ how did that feel</button></div></div></